+## New-thread model picker replacement
+
+`NewThreadComposerProps.experimental_ModelPicker` accepts a stable component of
+`ExperimentalNewThreadModelPickerProps`. It replaces only the execution picker
+in that composer. The host supplies its routed provider/model catalog and checks
+actions against verified, enabled options. Draft, project, environment and
+permissions remain host-owned; no seed props change. A rendering exception
+restores the native picker. No new CLI command is needed: this is rendering
+customization of the existing thread creation capability.
+
+Stabilization requires routed catalog/loading/error tests, invalid-action tests,
+draft/selection preservation, plugin crash fallback, and real desktop/mobile
+plugin adoption.
+
+The picker also receives `onPresetSelect(selection): Promise<void>` for complete
+provider/model/reasoning/tier presets. It validates against a fresh catalog for
+the current host/environment before applying all fields together. Catalog
+failures, unsupported efforts/fast mode, and routing changes reject without
+applying the preset. Submission is blocked while the preset is being checked.
